  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'How to move: Arrow Keys or WASD


    Health: You have 3 default hearts,
    and you gain 1 heart every level, maximum 6 hearts.


    Levels: You need 1
    full exp bar to level up and each level up you gain a heart, and after reaching
    maximum hearts, you gain +2.5% dodge attacks every level capping out at 4 levels.
    You gain EXP for defeating enemies.


    Battles: You go into battle when you
    touch an enemy. Enemies have a base miss chance of 10% which can go up to 20%
    at max level. The player will always go first in battle. After winning a battle,
    you gain 0.25 health. If it is a boss, you heal back to full health. After winning
    a battle, you gain a bit of gold and exp. If the enemy doesn''t miss, it has
    a 10% chance of hitting for an extra 0.25 damage.


    The Map: There are 3
    checkpoints, and 4 different bosses you can face. There are also 3 different
    kinds of enemies you can face throughout the map. You can also find items and
    gold throughout the map. At a checkpoint, there is a shop and healing station.
    You can buy 5 different moves and items using gold that you receive from battle.




'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
