  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Attack Minigames: All of the attacks have quick minigames where you\nhave
    to time something except for Run. For most of the attacks, if you lose \nthe
    minigame you just miss and do no damage. For Fireball, you take 0.25 damage.
    For Reckless Strike, you take 0.5 damage. For Thunder, you do 0.25 damage and
    are stunned next turn. All of the minigames are easy except for Reckless Strike
    and Multi-Slash. \n\nItems: \nBeet: Heals 0.5 health. Cost: 5 gold.\nSteak: Heals
    2.5 health. Cost: 30 gold.\nRootbeer: For the next battle, you heal 0.125 health
    if you miss. This includes if you win the Fireball minigame but still miss.This
    does not include if you stun yourself for Thunder after you win the minigame.
    Cost: 10 gold.\nYou can have 3 items in your inventory. Items are only useable
    outside of battle. \n\nOther Info: If you die, you lose 15-25% of your gold.
    You do not receive gold if you run from battle. You can't run from a boss battle.
    If you run, all enemies despawn and you respawn where your position originally
    was. Enemies spawn 0.5 to 3 seconds. \n\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
