--- !u!114 &1708342299
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1708342297}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Moves: You can equip 5 moves at a time. The default moves are Slash, \nFireball,
    and Run. Slash and Run are non-replaceable but Fireball can be \nreplaced. All
    moves except Run have easy minigames. Reckless strike and multi-slash have harder
    ones.\n\nSlash: Do a basic attack and deal 0.5 physical damage. Has a 10% to
    deal 0.75 damage instead\n\nFireball: Charge up a fireball and has a 70% chance
    to deal 1 damage, and a 30% to damage the Player. If it succesfully hits, there
    is a 10% to inflict burn, which deals 0.125 damage at the end of each turn. Is
    a special attacking move.\n\nRun: Has a 50% chance to Run, and 50% chance to
    deal 0.25 damage to the Player (You do not get health if you Run from battle).\n\nLife
    Drain: You hit for 0.25 special damage and leech health from the enemy, doing
    0.125 damage every turn and healing you for 0.0625. Cost: 25 gold. Only useable
    once per battle.\n\nMulti-Slash: Do a max of 5 basic attacks dealing 0.25 physical
    damage per attack, but is difficult to time. Cost: 30 gold. Useable every other
    turn.\n\nReckless Strike: Has a very difficult to time minigame, but if you succeed,
    you do 1.5  physical damage. If you fail, you are vulnerable and take 0.5 damage
    instead. Cost: 30 gold. Useable every 3rd turn.\n\nThunder: Strike the enemy
    with thunder dealing 0.75 special damage, with an 85% chance to stun the enemy,
    but if it fails, you get stunned for one turn instead. However, you still do
    damage. If you lose the minigame, you still do 0.25 damage. Cost: 35 gold. Useable
    every 3rd turn.\n\nBeatdown: After preparing for 1 turn, you attack the enemy
    with full power, dealing 1.75 physical damage. Cost: 40 gold. Useable every 3rd
    turn.\n\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
